OL,3,GNEWSARAF Fairford air show cancellation
OL,4,A'devastating'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospitality businesses have said they
OL,7,Fare facing a "huge loss" following the
OL,8,Fnews that the Royal International Air
OL,9,FTattoo (RIAT) will be leaving RAF
OL,10,FFairford in Gloucestershire.
OL,12,FRIAT has been held at the base for more
OL,13,Fthan 40 years but a decision has been
OL,14,Fmade to move it to the Ministry of
OL,15,FDefence's (MoD) Boscombe Down, in
OL,16,FWiltshire. The next show will be held
OL,17,Fthere from 16 to 18 July next year.
OL,19,FTanya Callowb@QTrujillo, reservations
OL,20,Fmanager at a pub in Meysey Hampton,
OL,21,Fsaid they would lose "a massive chunk
OL,22,Fof business" every year.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
