OL,3,GNEWSARAF Fairford air show cancellation
OL,4,A'devastating'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Royal Air Force Charitable Trust
OL,7,FEnterprises spokesperson said it would
OL,8,F"continue to be headquartered in
OL,9,FFairford and remains committed to the
OL,10,Ftown and community".
